# Security workflow Trivy suppressions — reviewed and approved.
#
# CVE-2025-47273 (setuptools)
#   The base python:3.11-slim image bundles setuptools 70.3.0 inside
#   pip's own package tree.  Our Dockerfile force-reinstalls setuptools
#   to >=78 but the stale dist-info shipped with the base image is not
#   always cleaned up.  The RAG application never calls
#   setuptools.package_index at runtime.
CVE-2025-47273

# GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964 (msgpack)
#   Same root cause — an older msgpack wheel is vendored in the base
#   image and its dist-info survives the upgrade.  Our application uses
#   the JSON serializer (not msgpack) for Celery task payloads.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
